An unavailable market conversion raises a clear error.

========== API ==========

aggregate({ to: '2024-01-01', inValuationCommodity: true })

========== FILE ==========

commodity SEK
  default
2024-01-01 Opening
  Assets:Other  1 OTHER {1 SEK}
  Equity:Opening  -1 SEK

========== ERROR ==========

No price for OTHER on or before 2024-01-01 can convert it to SEK
